  "id": "chicken-manicotti-alfredo",
  "name": "Chicken Manicotti Alfredo",
  "subtitle": "Baked manicotti with creamy Alfredo sauce and herbs",
  "description": "Chicken is marinated with garlic, cooked, and combined with a seasoned ricotta filling. The manicotti is covered with Alfredo sauce and mozzarella, then baked until bubbling and the chicken reaches a safe temperature.",
